### Create project
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HatuxDevLab",
  "description": "Main umbrella platform for my modules",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Get all projects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects

### Get project by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1

### Update project status
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Active"
}

### Get project by id again
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1

### Update project
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hatux DevLab Core",
  "description": "Central platform for personal modules",
  "priority": "Medium"
}